      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo 1 Maple Lawn is a 4 bed semi-detached home with development potential set on a corner site in this popular residential development in the heart of Johnstown. The property benefits from well laid out accommodation which spans approximately 125sq mt over two floors. There is ample off-street parking to the front with a private walled garden to the rear with a sunny aspect. Local amenities are within walking distance, including schools, Johnstown Shopping Centre and clubs while Navan town is a leisurely 15 minute walk along the banks of the river Boyne. Access to all of the major road networks are just minutes away by car and there is a regular bus service. Viewing come highly recommended"
      },
